":"Cave air"},{"f":"C5","de":"Operation","en":"Operation"}]},{"vde":"klopfen","ven":"knock","pde":"Schleim","pen":"Mucus","st":[{"f":"C1","de":"—","en":"—"},{"f":"C3","de":"Ruinenstaub","en":"Ruin dust"},{"f":"C6","de":"Operation","en":"Operation"}]},{"vde":"kühlen","ven":"cool","pde":"Gelenke","pen":"Joints","st":[{"f":"C2","de":"—","en":"—"},{"f":"C4","de":"Ruinenstaub","en":"Ruin dust"},{"f":"C7","de":"Wunder","en":"Miracle"}]}],"herk":{"Gift":[{"de":"Biss oder Stachel eines Tieres","en":"bite or sting of an animal","w":1.0},{"de":"präparierte Klinge oder Pfeil","en":"prepared blade or arrow","w":1.0},{"de":"Falle mit Giftnadel","en":"trap with a poison needle","w":1.0},{"de":"seltsamer Trank","en":"odd potion","w":1.0},{"de":"verdorbene Speise","en":"spoiled food","w":1.0},{"de":"Pflanzensaft oder Sporen","en":"plant sap or spores","w":1.0},{"de":"Dämpfe aus einem Riss im Boden","en":"fumes from a crack in the ground","w":1.0},{"de":"Getränk eines falschen Freundes","en":"drink from a false friend","w":1.0}],"Krankheit":[{"de":"Nässe während der Rast (Nässewurf)","en":"wetness during a rest (wetness roll)","w":1.0},{"de":"brackiges Wasser","en":"brackish water","w":1.0},{"de":"Staub einer alten Ruine","en":"dust of an old ruin","w":1.0},{"de":"Höhlenluft","en":"cave air","w":1.0},{"de":"Kontakt mit einem Kranken","en":"contact with a sick person","w":1.0},{"de":"Kadaver oder Unrat","en":"carcass or filth","w":1.0},{"de":"Insektenstich","en":"insect bite","w":1.0},{"de":"Umweltgefahr (Sumpfgas, Sporen …)","en":"environmental hazard (swamp gas, spores …)","w":1.0}]},"psy":[{"a":1,"b":6,"de":"Flucht","en":"Flight","dde":"Muss sofort vor der echten oder eingebildeten Gefahr fliehen. Nutzt alle Aktionen, um wegzulaufen, sich zu verstecken oder einen sicheren Ort zu finden. Sieht alles als Bedrohung – sogar die engsten Vertrauten.","den":"Heroes must flee immediately from danger, real or imagined. They use all actions to run away, hide, or find a safe place. They will perceive everything – even their closest confidants – as a threat."},{"a":7,"b":12,"de":"Kampf","en":"Fight","dde":"Schlägt verzweifelt wild um sich, um die Gefahr zu vertreiben. Nutzt alle Aktionen, um Kreaturen in der Nähe anzugreifen, ohne Freund und Feind zu unterscheiden – so viele Kreaturen wie möglich pro Runde.","den":"In desperation, heroes begin to thrash around wildly to drive away danger, real or imagined. They use all actions to attack creatures near them, making no distinction between friend and foe. They try to hit as many creatures as possible per round."},{"a":13,"b":20,"de":"Starre","en":"Paralysis","dde":"Die zersplitterte Seele blockiert den Geist: handlungsunfähig, gelähmt, kann nur starren und zusehen, wie sich die Lage entwickelt.","den":"The shattering blocks and suppresses the mind, and the heroes are unable to act. They are paralyzed and can only stare and watch how the situation develops."}],"trauma":[{"ade":"Kampfbeginn","aen":"start of combat","wde":"gelähmt – die Muskeln erstarren","wen":"paralyzed – your muscles freeze","dde":"1 Runde","den":"1 round","hde":"Hilf einer Person, obwohl du dich dabei selbst in Lebensgefahr bringst.","hen":"Help a person even though it puts your own life in danger.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Kampfbeginn","aen":"start of combat","wde":"geblendet 3 – Bilder der Gewalt haben sich in deine Augen gebrannt","wen":"blinded 3 – scenes of violence are burned into your eyes","dde":"1 Runde","den":"1 round","hde":"Schreite bei Unrecht ein, auch wenn es dir ernsthaft schadet.","hen":"Step in against injustice, even if it seriously harms you.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Kampfbeginn","aen":"start of combat","wde":"verwirrt – dein Geist ist aufgewühlt und überfordert","wen":"confused – your mind is churned up and overwhelmed","dde":"bis ein Focus-Rettungswurf gelingt","den":"until a focus-rescue-check succeeds","hde":"Finde einen Ort des Fokus – achte und schütze ihn.","hen":"Find a place of focus – respect and protect it.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Einsatz eines bestimmten Skills","aen":"use of a specific skill","wde":"betäubt – deine Glieder versagen, du kannst nur abwarten","wen":"stunned – your limbs fail you, you can only wait","dde":"sofort (2 Aktionen)","den":"immediately (2 actions)","hde":"Rette mit dem verhassten Skill einer Person das Leben.","hen":"Save a person’s life with the hated skill.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Einsatz eines bestimmten Skills","aen":"use of a specific skill","wde":"rasend – Erinnerungen lösen einen Wutanfall aus, zerstöre ein Objekt","wen":"raging – memories trigger a fit of rage, destroy an object","dde":"bis ein Focus-Rettungswurf gelingt","den":"until a focus-rescue-check succeeds","hde":"Rette mit dem verhassten Skill einer Person das Leben.","hen":"Save a person’s life with the hated skill.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Einsatz eines bestimmten Skills","aen":"use of a specific skill","wde":"gestürzt – Angst überkommt dich, du wirfst dich schützend zu Boden","wen":"fallen – fear overcomes you, you throw yourself to the ground","dde":"sofort","den":"immediately","hde":"Rette mit dem verhassten Skill einer Person das Leben.","hen":"Save a person’s life with the hated skill.","w":1.0},{"ade":"kritischer Fehlschlag","aen":"critical failure","wde":"Der Fehlschlag raubt dir den Antrieb: 1 Erschöpfung","wen":"the failure drains your drive: 1 exhaustion","dde":"sofort","den":"immediately","hde":"Gleiche den Fehler einer anderen Person aus.","hen":"Make up for another person’s mistake.","w":1.0},{"ade":"kritischer Fehlschlag","aen":"critical failure","wde":"rasend – Wut überkommt dich und benebelt deine Gedanken","wen":"raging – anger overcomes you and clouds your thoughts","dde":"bis ein Focus-Rettungswurf gelingt","den":"until a focus-rescue-check succeeds","hde":"Gleiche den Fehler einer anderen Person aus.","hen":"Make up for another person’s mistake.","w":1.0},{"ade":"kritischer Fehlschlag","aen":"critical failure","wde":"paranoid – dein Versagen lässt Panik in dir aufsteigen","wen":"paranoid – your failure makes panic rise in you","dde":"bis ein Trust-Rettungswurf gelingt","den":"until a trust-rescue-check succeeds","hde":"Gleiche den Fehler einer anderen Person aus.","hen":"Make up for another person’s mistake.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Dunkelheit oder Licht","aen":"darkness or light","wde":"künstliches Licht blendet dich: geblendet 1","wen":"artificial light dazzles you: blinded 1","dde":"solange du im künstlichen Licht bist","den":"while in artificial light","hde":"Bringe eine Lüge ans Licht, auch gegen deine eigenen Interessen.","hen":"Bring a lie to light, even against your own interests.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Dunkelheit oder Licht","aen":"darkness or light","wde":"weniger Licht als Fackellicht: −10 auf alle Skills","wen":"less light than torchlight: −10 to all skills","dde":"solange es so dunkel ist","den":"while it is this dark","hde":"Besiege einen Gegner in völliger Dunkelheit.","hen":"Defeat an enemy in complete darkness.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Dunkelheit oder Licht","aen":"darkness or light","wde":"in völliger Dunkelheit kannst du dich nicht bewegen","wen":"you cannot move in complete darkness","dde":"solange es völlig dunkel ist","den":"while it is completely dark","hde":"Besiege einen Gegner in völliger Dunkelheit.","hen":"Defeat an enemy in complete darkness.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Timing-Reihenfolge","aen":"timing order","wde":"Vorsicht: Du greifst keine Gegner an, die in der Timing-Reihenfolge vor dir handeln","wen":"caution: you do not attack enemies acting before you in the timing order","dde":"den ganzen Kampf","den":"the whole battle","hde":"Finde einen Ort des Fokus – achte und schütze ihn.","hen":"Find a place of focus – respect and protect it.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Timing-Reihenfolge","aen":"timing order","wde":"Tunnelblick: Du greifst keine Gegner an, die in der Timing-Reihenfolge nach dir handeln","wen":"tunnel vision: you do not attack enemies acting after you in the timing order","dde":"den ganzen Kampf","den":"the whole battle","hde":"Finde einen Ort des Fokus – achte und schütze ihn.","hen":"Find a place of focus – respect and protect it.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Timing-Reihenfolge","aen":"timing order","wde":"die Angst, dass Lügen dich einholen: paranoid, wenn Gegner vor dir handeln","wen":"fear that lies catch up with you: paranoid when enemies act before you","dde":"die Runde","den":"the round","hde":"Bringe eine Lüge ans Licht, auch gegen deine eigenen Interessen.","hen":"Bring a lie to light, even against your own interests.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Enge oder Weite","aen":"tight or open spaces","wde":"erstickend 1 – du glaubst, nicht atmen zu können","wen":"suffocating 1 – you feel you cannot breathe","dde":"solange du dort bist","den":"while you are there","hde":"Finde in der auslösenden Umgebung Sicherheit und schütze sie.","hen":"Find safety in the triggering surroundings and protect it.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Enge oder Weite","aen":"tight or open spaces","wde":"ein bestimmter Skill ist nicht möglich","wen":"one specific skill is impossible","dde":"solange du dort bist","den":"while you are there","hde":"Finde in der auslösenden Umgebung Sicherheit und schütze sie.","hen":"Find safety in the triggering surroundings and protect it.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Enge oder Weite","aen":"tight or open spaces","wde":"unwohl und unsicher: −5 auf alle Skills","wen":"uneasy and insecure: −5 to all skills","dde":"solange du dort bist","den":"while you are there","hde":"Lass dich in der auslösenden Umgebung von einem Verbündeten retten.","hen":"Be rescued by an ally in the triggering surroundings.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Enge oder Weite","aen":"tight or open spaces","wde":"überfordert und verloren: −5 auf alle Kampfskills","wen":"overwhelmed and lost: −5 to all combat-skills","dde":"solange du dort bist","den":"while you are there","hde":"Lass dich in der auslösenden Umgebung von einem Verbündeten retten.","hen":"Be rescued by an ally in the triggering surroundings.","w":1.0},{"ade":"negative Reserve","aen":"negative reserve","wde":"1 Erschöpfung, wenn eine Reserve negativ wird","wen":"1 exhaustion when a reserve becomes negative","dde":"sofort","den":"immediately","hde":"Gönn dir ausreichend Zeit für Erholung und Entspannung.","hen":"Take enough time to recover and relax.","w":1.0},{"ade":"negative Reserve","aen":"negative reserve","wde":"verwirrt","wen":"confused","dde":"solange die Reserve negativ ist","den":"while the reserve is negative","hde":"Finde einen Ort des Fokus – achte und schütze ihn.","hen":"Find a place of focus – respect and protect it.","w":1.0},{"ade":"negative Reserve","aen":"negative reserve","wde":"Erschöpfung sinkt nicht","wen":"exhaustion does not decrease","dde":"solange die Reserve negativ ist","den":"while the reserve is negative","hde":"Gönn dir ausreichend Zeit für Erholung und Entspannung.","hen":"Take enough time to recover and relax.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Wasser","aen":"water","wde":"erstickend 1","wen":"suffocating 1","dde":"solange du hüfthoch im Wasser bist","den":"while you are waist-deep in water","hde":"Lerne, tief zu tauchen und das Wasser zu respektieren.","hen":"Learn to dive deep and respect the water.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Wasser","aen":"water","wde":"betäubt bei Kontakt mit mehr als einem Liter Wasser","wen":"stunned on contact with more than a liter of water","dde":"sofort (2 Aktionen)","den":"immediately (2 actions)","hde":"Lerne, tief zu tauchen und das Wasser zu schätzen.","hen":"Learn to dive deep and appreciate the water.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Kreaturenart oder Gegenstand","aen":"creature type or object","wde":"verängstigt – du kannst dich ihm nicht nähern","wen":"scared – you cannot get closer to it","dde":"solange du es wahrnimmst","den":"while you perceive it","hde":"Freunde dich mit dieser Kreaturenart an oder stelle einen hochwertigen solchen Gegenstand her.","hen":"Befriend that creature type or craft a high-quality such object.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Kreaturenart oder Gegenstand","aen":"creature type or object","wde":"panisch – der Anblick löst Panik aus","wen":"panicked – the sight causes panic","dde":"solange du es wahrnimmst","den":"while you perceive it","hde":"Freunde dich mit dieser Kreaturenart an oder stelle einen hochwertigen solchen Gegenstand her.","hen":"Befriend that creature type or craft a high-quality such object.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Kreaturenart oder Gegenstand","aen":"creature type or object","wde":"verzaubert – Schuldgefühle, du kannst ihm nicht schaden","wen":"enchanted – guilt, you cannot harm it","dde":"solange du es wahrnimmst","den":"while you perceive it","hde":"Rette eine feindliche Kreatur dieser Art oder einen solchen Gegenstand gegen deine Interessen.","hen":"Save a hostile creature of that type or such an object against your interests.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Manie","aen":"mania","wde":"Ablutomanie – der Drang, dich gründlich zu waschen","wen":"ablutomania – the urge to wash thoroughly","dde":"vor jeder Rast erfüllen, sonst keine Auto-Erholung","den":"fulfill before each rest, else no auto-recovery","hde":"Hilf einer Kreatur, sich selbst so zu lieben, wie sie ist.","hen":"Help a creature love itself as it is.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Manie","aen":"mania","wde":"Kleptomanie – stiehl einer anderen Person einen Gegenstand","wen":"kleptomania – steal an item from another person","dde":"vor jeder Rast erfüllen, sonst keine Auto-Erholung","den":"fulfill before each rest, else no auto-recovery","hde":"Hilf einer Person mit einem Gegenstand, der ihr gestohlen wurde.","hen":"Help a person with an item that was stolen from them.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Manie","aen":"mania","wde":"Doromanie – schenk einer anderen Person etwas, das sie schätzt","wen":"doromania – give another person something they value","dde":"vor jeder Rast erfüllen, sonst keine Auto-Erholung","den":"fulfill before each rest, else no auto-recovery","hde":"Erhalte dein Wunschgeschenk von einem wahren Freund.","hen":"Receive your wished-for gift from a true friend.","w":1.0},{"ade":"Manie","aen":"mania","wde":"Nosomanie – du bildest dir die Symptome einer leichten Kra